{"channelId":"UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","row":["Sochi Said",745,"To be real. I want to create a platform where I can create and share.  I am an empty nester in my late 40s and I feel like I'm living the best part of my life.  I feel accomplished as a mother, and wife and now want to be as creative as I can be and have fun doing it.  I want to share my fun thrift trips.  I love to create cute outfits with thrifted clothes, as well as decorate my house using thrifted treasures. I work from home as a massage therapist in what I call the perfect situation. We built the house of our dreams and along with that, I built my very own massage studio and office so that I can see clients at home!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:25.785Z","channelId":"UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ce53657c01727449cc79d2d91ca30a09e7ba24c9db9b3ecefdc018ecaf34b1c6","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f68ba8aa46076708c7d8a0745105e03dcfb6e05e0ac6d5b019cf0c273f2010f1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:25.785Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":745,"raw":"745 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIUdvuZ_NH1nxUF-Nw0sz3w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:25.785Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","